%% Main paint frame sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant PlanCache as PaintPlanCache
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Resolver as CanvasResourceResolver
  participant Painter as Main painter

  Surface->>Frame: paint main scene request(viewportRect, cameraOffset, dpr, resolver)
  Frame->>Store: capture committed tables, revisions, camera, viewport, and selection once
  Store-->>Frame: documentRevision, structuralRevision, boundsRevision, visualRevision, selectionRevision, resourceRevision, cameraOffset, viewportRect, selectionIds
  Frame->>Preview: capture immutable selected move preview once
  Preview-->>Frame: selectedMoveDelta or none
  Note over Frame: CapturedMainFrame freezes the runtime facts used by this main paint frame.

  Frame->>PlanCache: lookup paint plan by structural, bounds, visual, viewport, and selection keys

  alt paint plan cache hit
    PlanCache-->>Frame: immutable RenderElementRecord list
  else paint plan cache miss
    Frame->>Spatial: query paint candidates bounded by captured viewportRect
    Spatial-->>Frame: ordinary candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision

    opt selectedMoveDelta is active
      Frame->>Spatial: query selected supplement using visibilityRect shifted by -selectedMoveDelta
      Spatial-->>Frame: selected candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision
    end

    loop for each ordinary or selected candidate handle
      Frame->>Store: resolve handle against captured structuralRevision and generation
      alt handle generation and structuralRevision still match the captured frame
        Store-->>Frame: immutable family row view, common paint fields, selection flags, and resourceId if any
        Frame->>Frame: build RenderElementRecord with row view and previewDelta for selected moved records
      else stale candidate
        Store-->>Frame: reject stale candidate
        Frame->>Frame: skip record for stale generation or structuralRevision
      end
    end

    Frame->>Frame: merge ordinary and selected supplement records by orderToken
    Note over Frame: No full-scene sort and no CanvasDocument materialization.
    Frame->>PlanCache: store immutable ordered RenderElementRecord list
  end

  opt records include image resource ids
    loop for each image resource id in records
      Frame->>Resources: resolve paint asset(resourceId, captured resourceRevision, resolver)
      Resources->>Store: read committed descriptor for resource id
      Store-->>Resources: appKey descriptor or missing descriptor

      alt cached resolved image is current
        Resources-->>Frame: app-owned image paint asset
      else descriptor missing or resolver returns null
        Resources-->>Frame: bounded missing image placeholder
      else sync resolver call required
        Resources->>Resolver: resolveImage(appKey descriptor)
        Resolver-->>Resources: app-owned image or null
        Resources-->>Frame: resolved image or bounded placeholder
      end
    end
  end

  Frame->>Painter: paint immutable records, resolved assets, and bounded frame render caches
  Painter-->>Surface: draw main scene

  Note over Painter: Painter consumes immutable RenderElementRecord data only, it performs no live runtime reads.
  Note over Frame,Store: Forbidden in main paint: Store mutation, CanvasDocument projection, DocumentProjectionCache read, public API reads, and InteractionEngine mutation.
  Note over Resources,Resolver: ResourceKernel owns the app resolver boundary, painter never calls the application resolver directly.
  Note over Surface,Painter: No legacy scene, controller, snapshot, or public DTO entities participate in this sequence.
